{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22009","headline":"赠友五首 五 · 白居易","name":"赠友五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十男有室，二十女有归。\n近代多离乱，婚姻多过期。\n嫁娶既不早，生育常苦迟。\n儿女未成人，父母已衰羸。\n凡人贵达日，多在长大时。\n欲报亲不待，孝心无所施。\n哀哉三牲养，少得及庭闱。\n惜哉万锺粟，多用饱妻儿。\n谁能正婚礼，待君张国维。\n庶使孝子心，皆无风树悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}